{"id":"69f9994fe732757d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-zero-function.md","title":"Zero Function","display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-zero-function","aliases":["88-df-zero-function"],"display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-zero-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-zero-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-function — Zero Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(Z_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> zero function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> (historical unary-zero abbreviation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(Z_k(\\vec x)=0)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(Z_k(\\vec x)=0)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\nZ\\coloneqq Z_1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\nZ\\coloneqq Z_1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>把零函数按元数编号后，闭包定义不再把一元<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>错误地直接当作任意\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元初始函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>给出常量零。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(Z_k(\\vec x)=0)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function}\\vdash\nZ\\coloneqq Z_1","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false}],"bytes":784,"backlinks":[{"id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ce76a1073595f5b0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84fe0214dffac7e4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z_k,P_i^k,\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k,\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ 分别取 [[88-df-zero-function]]、[[88-df-projection-function]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]、[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]；该递归方案的递归参数位于第一位。"},{"id":"7099f3791c655614","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"245643a3d9f97585","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"co